{
  "title": "An effective daily prayer",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "سُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ كَمَا يَنْبَغِىْ لِلّٰهِ\nSUBHAANAL LAAHE KAMAA YANBAGHEE LILLAAH\nGlory be to Allah as He deserves,\nوَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ كَمَا يَنْبَغِىْ لِلّٰهِ\nWAL HAMDO LILLAAHE KAMAA YANBAGHEE LILLAAH\nand praise be to Allah as He deserves,\nوَ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ كَمَا يَنْبَغِىْ لِلّٰهِ\nWA LAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO KAMAA YANBAGHEE LILLAAH\nand there is no god but Allah as He deserves,\nوَاللّٰهُ اَكْبَرُ كَمَا يَنْبَغِىْ لِلّٰهِ\nWALLAAHO AKBARU KAMAA YANBAGHEE LILLAAH\nand Allah is greater as He deserves,\nوَ لَا حَوْلَ وَ لَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللّٰهِ\nWA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QOOWATA ILLAA BILLAAH\nand there is no power and no might except with Allah,\nوَ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ النَّبِىِّ وَ عَلٰى اَهْلِ بَيْتِهِ وَ جَمِيْعِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ وَ النَّبِيِّيْنَ حَتّٰى يَرْضَى اللّٰهُ\nWA SALLAL LAAHO ALAA MOHAMMADININ NABIYYE WA ALAA AHLE BAYTEHI WA JAMEE-IL MURSALEENA WAN NABIYYEENA HATTAA YARZAL LAAHO\nand may Allah send blessings upon Muhammad the Prophet and upon his Household and all the Messengers and Prophets, until Allah is pleased.",
  "merits": "In his book al-Da'awat, al-Qutb al-Rawandi reports Imam al-Rida (a.s.) quoting the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.): whoever wishes his status in the Highest Group to excel that of the warriors for Allah's sake should repeat this glorification every day. If he has a request, it will be granted; if he has an enemy, that enemy will be suppressed; if he has a debt, it will be settled; if he is in agony, he will be relieved; and his words will penetrate the Seven Skies to be written in the Preserved Tablet (al-Lawh al-Mahfuz)."
}
